sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Driver
participant App as Mobile App
participant RS as Reservation Service
participant PS as ParkingSpot
participant PG as Payment Gateway
participant N as Notification Service
Driver->>App: Select spot & time
App->>RS: reserveSpot(spotId, time)
RS->>PS: checkAvailability()
PS-->>RS: Available
RS->>PS: setStatus(Reserved)
RS-->>App: Reservation created (amount due)
App-->>Driver: Show payment screen
Driver->>App: Enter payment details
App->>PG: processPayment(amount)
alt Payment successful
PG-->>App: Success
App->>RS: confirmReservation()
RS->>N: sendConfirmation()
N-->>Driver: Booking confirmed + directions
else Payment failed
PG-->>App: Failure
App->>RS: cancelReservation()
RS->>PS: setStatus(Available)
App-->>Driver: Payment failed, try again
end
